@talks kovac-zainab
// TW1, the Talk a while pack: Zainab Kovac's own talks. Shy, careful, exact; a word then a pause; says sorry for
// nothing; fluent, even bossy, about scrubbers; counts things. Never admits the lift (until beat kovac.2).

== scrubber
topic: work
them: Oh. Um. Hi. Sorry. I was timing myself. A scrubber. Stripped and back together.
them: People say ten minutes flat. It's nine and a half. Not that I'm counting. I am counting.   #funny
ask: Is there a job you like doing just because it's neat?
listen: What's the trick to nine and a half?
  them: Lay the parts out in order. Left to right. Then never think. Just hands.
share: Coiling cables. Properly.
  them: Oh. Yes. Over-under. If you do it over-under I'll. I'll respect you a lot.   #warm
cheer: Eating a biscuit in one go.
  them: That's. Fourteen seconds. I've seen Pell. Sorry.   #funny

== knitting-circle
topic: hobby
when: tier>=acquaintance
them: Knit and natter's on Tuesday. Junior common room. Me, Dahl, Torres.
them: Torres's scarves are very. Um. Enthusiastic. I'm not going to say anything. Ever.   #funny
ask: Would you want to learn? You don't have to. It's fine.
listen: How long have you been knitting?
  them: Since I was small. My hands like having something to do. Otherwise they fidget.
share: I'd like that. I'll be slow.
  them: Oh. Good. Slow's good. Slow is how it comes out even.   #warm
cheer: Only if I can make something lumpy.
  them: Then you'd be in Torres's school. He'd be. Thrilled.   #funny

== spanners
topic: crew
when: tier>=colleague
them: Someone put the spanners back out of order. Seventeen, then fourteen, then nineteen.
them: I fixed it. Nobody saw. Don't. Um. Don't tell anyone it was me.
ask: What's the thing you fix that nobody notices?
listen: Do you know who it was?
  them: Yes. It's always the same person. I like them. That's why I fix it quietly.   #warm
share: My bunk corner. I tidy it twice a day.
  them: Oh. Me too. Twice. Exactly twice. Good.   #warm
cheer: The tea rota, when Halloran's not looking.
  them: Oh no. I do that too. Don't tell him.   #funny

== garden-beans
topic: plans
when: tier>=friend
them: My beans are coming up in the garden. Forty-two. I counted. They're all doing well.
them: Cruz says I can have a bigger tray next season. I said "if that's all right". Twice.   #funny
ask: Is there something you're growing? Not plants. You know. Something.
listen: What will you do with forty-two beans?
  them: Give them to Brennan. She'll do something lovely. I'll eat them all quietly.   #warm
share: Getting braver, maybe. Slowly.
  them: Oh. Me too. I think. Slowly's still growing. Isn't it. It is.   #warm
cheer: My laundry pile. It's thriving.
  them: Oh. That's. Very good. Water it with soap.   #funny
